# Mintlify automatically ignores these files and directories:
# .git, .github, .claude, .agents, .idea, node_modules,
# README.md, LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md

# Agent config not covered by the built-in ignores.
# Mintlify's built-ins cover .git, .github, .claude, .agents, .idea, node_modules,
# README.md, LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md and CONTRIBUTING.md -- but NOT other repo-root
# Markdown, so an un-ignored AGENTS.md is served publicly at /agents.md.
.cursor/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Draft content
drafts/
*.draft.mdx
